usage:
Optional Extension configuration:
{"clock":"[time:%H:%M;Europe/Brussels]","burn_in_shift_minutes":60,"rain_color":"#00FF41","clock_color":"#00FF41","font_family":"doto","font_size":18,"speed":1.0,"density":0.8,"trail_length":1.0}

clock is an optional [time:...] binding that displays HH:MM and updates directly when its value changes. Normal rain skips clock cells. burn_in_shift_minutes defaults to 60 and cycles the clock vertically by one character cell; set it to 0 to disable this protection. The widget background is used for animation clearing. rain_color and clock_color accept six-digit RGB values with an optional leading # and default to #00FF41. The widget must be at least five character cells wide for the clock. Specify an Olson timezone after a semicolon; no timezone uses UTC. font_family accepts default, dseg7, bebas, or doto. font_size accepts the firmware's compiled font sizes from 12 to 48 pixels. speed ranges from 0.1 to 12.0, density from 0.0 to 1.0, and trail_length from 0.25 to 2.0. Configure the widget-level extension_tick_interval_ms from 33 to 1000 milliseconds to control animation cadence.
